WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
With a subscription, connect your own Meta ad account. Ad spend is paid to Meta, separately.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.000
The campaign builder starts from your plan: a Sales campaign, sending people to your shop.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.800
MAIRO suggests who to reach, and Meta refines it as results come in.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.800
You set the budget. Meta charges it to your own ad account.

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.600
Your approved creative, previewed where it will run.

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.000
Nothing runs until you agree to the spend and approve it.

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.500
And it's shown as live only once Meta confirms it.
